<< /A << /BBox [ 0 0 612 1008 ] /O /Layout >> /Alt (Hand-drawn draft diagram with a plan view and a cross section of a proposed driveway entrance from an existing highway. Plan view: entrance radius R of 15 feet minimum, 25 feet desirable, and entrance width W of 12 feet suggested minimum, 50 feet maximum allowable, with an entrance pipe under the entrance. Cross section: 6 inches suggested minimum cover over the pipe, 12 inches desirable, a 24 foot pipe at the flow line of the ditch, the entrance width, suggested 2 foot shoulders, and pipe length as needed.) /K 0 /P 11 0 R /Pg 27 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
